+<entry>
+<title>RUSTSEC-2026-0588: Vulnerability in ruma-identifiers-validation</title>
+<id>https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0588.html</id>
+<updated>2026-11-22T12:00:00+00:00</updated>
+<category term="denial-of-service"/>
+<link href="https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0588.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="RUSTSEC-2026-0588: Vulnerability in ruma-identifiers-validation"/>
+<published>2026-11-22T12:00:00+00:00</published>
+<summary xml:lang="en">Validating Matrix Content URIs may panic</summary>
+<content xml:lang="en" type="html">
+<article>
+<span class="floating-menu">
+<a href="https://github.com/RustSec/advisory-db/commits/main/crates/ruma-identifiers-validation/RUSTSEC-2026-0588.md">History</a> ⋅
+<a href="https://github.com/RustSec/advisory-db/edit/main/crates/ruma-identifiers-validation/RUSTSEC-2026-0588.md">Edit</a> ⋅
+<a href="https://api.osv.dev/v1/vulns/RUSTSEC-2026-0588">JSON (OSV)</a>
+</span>
+<header>
+<h1>
+RUSTSEC-2026-0588
+</h1>
+<span class="subtitle">
+<p>Validating Matrix Content URIs may panic</p>
+</span>
+</header>
+<dl>
+<dt id="reported">Reported</dt>
+<dd>
+<time datetime="2026-11-19">
+November 19, 2026
+</time>
+</dd>
+<dt id="issued">Issued</dt>
+<dd>
+<time datetime="2026-11-22">
+November 22, 2026
+</time>
+</dd>
+<dt id="package">Package</dt>
+<dd>
+<a href="/packages/ruma-identifiers-validation.html">ruma-identifiers-validation</a>
+(<a href="https://crates.io/crates/ruma-identifiers-validation">crates.io</a>)
+</dd>
+<dt id="type">Type</dt>
+<dd>
+Vulnerability
+</dd>
+<dt id="categories">Categories</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<a href="/categories/denial-of-service.html">denial-of-service</a>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+<dt id="details">References</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<a href="https://github.com/ruma/ruma/commit/caf1ac05a9fd347158b60505ef8546a2ff18ae7c">
+https://github.com/ruma/ruma/commit/caf1ac05a9fd347158b60505ef8546a2ff18ae7c
+</a>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+<dt id="patched">Patched</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<code>&#62;=0.13.0</code>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+<dt id="unaffected">Unaffected</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<code>&#60;0.2.3</code>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+</dl>
+<dl>
+<dt>Affected Functions</dt>
+<dd>Version</dd>
+<dt>
+<code>ruma_identifiers_validation::mxc_uri::validate</code>
+</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<code>&#60;0.13.0, &#62;=0.2.3</code>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+</dl>
+<h3 id="description">Description</h3>
+<p>Using <code>mxc_uri::validate</code> may panic if the server name part of the URI is larger
+than 249 bytes. The affected versions assumed that the length of the first part
+of the URI (<code>mxc://{server_name}</code>) would fit into a <code>NonZeroU8</code>, but the length
+of the server name wasn't validated and the Matrix specification actually allows
+the server name to have a maximum length of 261 bytes.</p>
