+<time datetime="2026-11-19">
+November 19, 2026
+</time>
+</dd>
+<dt id="issued">Issued</dt>
+<dd>
+<time datetime="2026-11-22">
+November 22, 2026
+</time>
+</dd>
+<dt id="package">Package</dt>
+<dd>
+<a href="/packages/ruma-identifiers-validation.html">ruma-identifiers-validation</a>
+(<a href="https://crates.io/crates/ruma-identifiers-validation">crates.io</a>)
+</dd>
+<dt id="type">Type</dt>
+<dd>
+Vulnerability
+</dd>
+<dt id="categories">Categories</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<a href="/categories/denial-of-service.html">denial-of-service</a>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+<dt id="details">References</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<a href="https://github.com/ruma/ruma/commit/b2cb9b43efbe082e4d9292560d4c9f0db5734038">
+https://github.com/ruma/ruma/commit/b2cb9b43efbe082e4d9292560d4c9f0db5734038
+</a>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+<dt id="patched">Patched</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<code>&#62;=0.14.0</code>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+</dl>
+<dl>
+<dt>Affected Functions</dt>
+<dd>Version</dd>
+<dt>
+<code>ruma_identifiers_validation::key_id::validate</code>
+</dt>
+<dd>
+<ul>
+<li>
+<code>&#60;0.14.0</code>
+</li>
+</ul>
+</dd>
+</dl>
+<h3 id="description">Description</h3>
+<p>Using <code>key_id::validate</code> may panic if the <code>algorithm</code> part of the key ID is
+longer than 255 bytes and contains non-ASCII characters. The affected versions
+assumed that the length of the first part containing the encryption or signing
+algorithm (the part before the colon) would fit into a <code>NonZeroU8</code>, but the
+length of the first part wasn't validated.</p>
